<headroom-library version="1" id="hg-bay-area-scoop" category="High Gain" order="50" instrument="guitar" style="Thrash">
  <description>Mid-80s Bay Area thrash rhythm: a saturated boutique lead channel, then a graphic EQ in a hard V (lows and highs up, low mids cut deep), into a 4x12 with 25-watt speakers. Tight, chunky and aggressive for downpicked palm mutes and gallops; the gate keeps the stops dead.</description>
  <tags><tag>High Gain</tag><tag>Thrash</tag><tag>80s</tag><tag>Rhythm</tag><tag>Scooped</tag><tag>Gate</tag><tag>Downpicking</tag></tags>
  <sources>
